# DumiFlix engine configuration inventory.
# Uncomment, fill, and export only the settings you need.
# Leave unused settings unset; empty numeric settings may be invalid.
# Defaults and full descriptions are in README.md.

# Server and TV control
# DUMIFLIX_TV_BIND=
# DUMIFLIX_TV_PORT=
# DUMIFLIX_TV_TOKEN=
# DUMIFLIX_TV_CONN_TIMEOUT=
# DUMIFLIX_TV_HOST=
# DUMIFLIX_LOG_DIR=
# DUMIFLIX_LOG_KEEP_DAYS=

# Remux and tools
